      ("Why it matters in Orange County",
       "<p>Orange County is a major retail and tourism market of 3,186,989 residents (2020 census), with destinations such as Downtown Disney and Anaheim GardenWalk in Anaheim aimed at visitors. Local boutiques, specialty shops and e-commerce brands in Anaheim, Irvine, Santa Ana and Costa Mesa compete with national chains for the same holiday shoppers. A cart that follows shoppers across Search and Gemini rewards stores whose products are already well described in Google.</p>"),
